msgctxt "#30070"
msgid "Legal and official streaming options for any Sentinel profile:\n\n- Plex - official Kodi add-on (plex.tv); live TV and on-demand, with a free ad-supported tier\n- Pluto TV - free ad-supported live channels and on-demand movies/shows\n- YouTube - official add-on available in the Kodi add-on repository\n- Tubi - free ad-supported movies and TV shows\n- PBS Kids - free children's programming\n- Netflix, Disney+, Prime Video - use the official apps on your Fire TV / Android TV home screen alongside Kodi\n- PVR IPTV Simple Client - connect your own legally licensed IPTV M3U playlist and EPG\n\nInstall these from the official Kodi add-on repository or their respective official sources."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30100"
msgid "Recommended profile and widget settings by device:\n\n- Fire TV Stick (1st/2nd gen, 1GB RAM): Sentinel Lite profile, limit home screen widgets to 1-2 rows, disable auto-updates during use\n- Fire TV Stick 4K / 4K Max: Sentinel Premium profile, 2-3 widget rows, FENtastic skin recommended\n- Nvidia Shield / high-end Android TV: Sentinel Max profile, full widget layout, Arctic Fuse skin optional\n\nIf a device feels sluggish, drop to the next lower profile, reduce widget rows in skin settings, and use Maintenance > Clear General Cache and Clear Thumbnail Cache regularly."
msgstr ""
